OL,3,ACopper wire upgrade behind US flight
OL,4,Asuspension, transport secretary says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThough the ground stop was lifted on
OL,7,FFriday evening, it had a knock-on
OL,8,Feffect on air travel on Saturday as
OL,9,Fairlines attempted to clear a backlog
OL,10,Fof flights.
OL,12,FOfficials including Duffy had
OL,13,Fpreviously attributed the issue to
OL,14,Foutdated equipment.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
