OL,3,APope Leo speaks of community
OL,4,A'suffering' on visit to remote Andes
OL,5,Atown
OL,6,
OL,7,FPope Leo XIV has spoken about the
OL,8,F"suffering of those who are forced to
OL,9,Fleave their homeland in search of a
OL,10,Fbetter future", which he said had left
OL,11,Fcommunities under threat, during a
OL,12,Fvisit to an isolated Andean village in
OL,13,Fhis former diocese.
OL,15,FAbout 6,000 people live in Santa Cruz
OL,16,Fde Succhabamba, located in a remote
OL,17,Fpart of the Andes mountains of northern
OL,18,FPeru, but the Pope's visit still drew a
OL,19,Fcrowd of about 20,000, according to the
OL,20,FVatican.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
