OL,3,AJudge temporarily blocks Trump from
OL,4,Aclosing Washington DC golf course for
OL,5,Arenovation
OL,6,
OL,7,FA federal judge has temporarily blocked
OL,8,Fthe US government's closure of an
OL,9,Fhistoric golf course and park in
OL,10,FWashington DC.
OL,12,FUS District Judge Ana Reyes has been
OL,13,Foverseeing a months-long challenge to
OL,14,Fthe president's plans for East Potomac
OL,15,FGolf Links, which he said would be
OL,16,Fclosed from 15 November for extensive
OL,17,Frenovations.
OL,19,FReyes has said Donald Trump cannot
OL,20,Fclose the park nor its golf course, but
OL,21,Fadded that his administration was not
OL,22,Frequired to actively manage either.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
